Title: To Dorrim
Author: Dorrim's Daughter
Color: 3D2518


- The heat of the forge holds the shape of what was lost.
<>[br]
<>Let the hammer speak — it still remembers.
<>[br]
<>[br]
<>And if something stirs… father, please, do not listen.
<>[br]
<>Not everything that calls wishes to be saved.
<>[br]
<>And not everything you’ve forgotten should return.
<>[br]
<>[br]
<>Stay. Far from the sunless land.
<>[br]
<>Far from the ruins, and the drowned throne.